        "l": 147.7455,
        "t": 421.50375,
        "r": 539.0576249999999,
        "b": 395.24625
      },
      "content": "l They  detect  a  lead-off  condition  if  one  of  the  electrode  connections  is disrupted.",
      "section_id": "sec_10_3",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_6",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
